    "text": "Key terms Objective of general purpose financial reporting Primary users (existing and potential investors, lenders and other creditors) Resource-provision decisions — buy, sell or hold; provide or settle credit; vote or influence Expected returns Prospects for future net cash inflows (amount, timing, uncertainty) Management accountability (CF term: stewardship ) Economic resources / claims Financial performance Accrual accounting Cash flows Useful financial information Disclaimer — personal study pack. These Conceptual Framework 2018 pages are personal study notes for private learning. They are not accounting, legal, or professional advice, and are not for commercial or mass redistribution. The Conceptual Framework does not override an applicable IFRS Standard. Official Standards remain authoritative. Big4 / firm-manual material appears only as short teaching paraphrase or cited extracts for private study. Do not treat this site as a substitute for the Official text, firm manuals, or professional advice."
