    "text": "Key terms Qualitative characteristics — fundamental / enhancing Relevance — predictive value / confirmatory value Materiality — omitting, misstating or obscuring; nature or magnitude Faithful representation — complete / neutral / free from error Substance over form Prudence — cautious (Framework) vs asymmetric (rejected) Measurement uncertainty Comparability / consistency / uniformity Verifiability — direct / indirect Timeliness / understandability Cost constraint Disclaimer — personal study pack. These Conceptual Framework 2018 pages are personal study notes for private learning. They are not accounting, legal, or professional advice, and are not for commercial or mass redistribution. The Conceptual Framework does not override an applicable IFRS Standard. Official Standards remain authoritative. Big4 / firm-manual material appears only as short teaching paraphrase or cited extracts for private study. Do not treat this site as a substitute for the Official text, firm manuals, or professional advice."
