    "text": "Key terms Financial statements (general purpose) Reporting period / comparative information Forward-looking information Entity perspective Going concern Reporting entity Boundary of the reporting entity Consolidated financial statements Unconsolidated financial statements (IAS 27: separate financial statements) Combined financial statements Control (parent–subsidiary link — high level) Disclaimer — personal study pack. These Conceptual Framework 2018 pages are personal study notes for private learning. They are not accounting, legal, or professional advice, and are not for commercial or mass redistribution. The Conceptual Framework does not override an applicable IFRS Standard. Official Standards remain authoritative. Big4 / firm-manual material appears only as short teaching paraphrase or cited extracts for private study. Do not treat this site as a substitute for the Official text, firm manuals, or professional advice."
