    "text": "Key terms Asset / economic resource / right / control Liability / obligation / transfer / past events Practical ability to avoid / constructive obligation Existence uncertainty Equity / residual interest / equity claim Income / expenses Contributions from / distributions to holders of equity claims Unit of account Executory contract Substance of contractual rights and obligations Asset ∥ Liability symmetry Disclaimer — personal study pack. These Conceptual Framework 2018 pages are personal study notes for private learning. They are not accounting, legal, or professional advice, and are not for commercial or mass redistribution. The Conceptual Framework does not override an applicable IFRS Standard. Official Standards remain authoritative. Big4 / firm-manual material appears only as short teaching paraphrase or cited extracts for private study. Do not treat this site as a substitute for the Official text, firm manuals, or professional advice."
