    "href": "../cf-2018/draft-v1-linked/ch07.html#s-7-6",
    "text": "7.6 IFRS 18 see-also See also IFRS 18 — Presentation and Disclosure in Financial Statements (operational statement structure, categories, required totals/subtotals). This chapter remains at Conceptual Framework level."
