    "text": "Key terms Concepts of capital Financial concept of capital Physical concept of capital Financial capital maintenance Physical capital maintenance Productive capacity / operating capability Nominal monetary units / constant purchasing power Profit determination Return on capital / return of capital Holding gains Capital maintenance adjustments / revaluation reserves Accounting model Disclaimer — personal study pack. These Conceptual Framework 2018 pages are personal study notes for private learning. They are not accounting, legal, or professional advice, and are not for commercial or mass redistribution. The Conceptual Framework does not override an applicable IFRS Standard. Official Standards remain authoritative. Big4 / firm-manual material appears only as short teaching paraphrase or cited extracts for private study. Do not treat this site as a substitute for the Official text, firm manuals, or professional advice."
