    "text": "3.9 Government grants tip The carrying amount of an item of PPE may be reduced by government grants in accordance with IAS 20. IAS 16 · para 28 PwC MOA 2020 Ch22 · 22.36 DTT iGAAP 2022 A7 · 4.3.5 EY iGAAP 2026 Ch19 · section 4.6 KPMG Insights 2019/20 · 3.2 · 3.2.390.10 Thin tip only. IAS 20 offers presentation choices (deduct from asset carrying amount, or defer as deferred income). A grant may be cash or a non-monetary asset. Full IAS 20 mechanics are outside this pack — apply IAS 20 when a grant relates to PPE. IAS 20 KPMG Insights 2019/20 · 3.2 · 3.2.390.10 See also — IAS 20. Accounting for government grants related to assets. IAS 16 · para 28 IAS 20"
