    "text": "1.3 What carries forward and what moves Much of IAS 1 continues — carried forward into IFRS 18 or moved to IAS 8 and IFRS 7 without substantive change. Those topics are mapped at paragraph level below rather than taught again. The Board focused on the statement of profit or loss rather than a full rewrite of IAS 1, and IAS 8, renamed Basis of Preparation of Financial Statements, absorbs IAS 1 requirements. Board focus was the statement of profit or loss — not a full rewrite of IAS 1: Single Standard retained, IAS 1 wording updated: The IASB did not reconsider all aspects of IAS 1 when developing IFRS 18, but instead focused on the statement of profit or loss. The IASB nonetheless kept a single Standard for presentation and disclosure; it retained some IAS 1 paragraphs in IFRS 18, moved some to IAS 8 / IFRS 7, and updated retained wording for consistency with IFRS 18 decisions and the 2018 Conceptual Framework. While much of IAS 1 will be carried forward to the new standard with only limited wording changes… IFRS 18 · para BC1 EY Closer look 2026 · Overview New layout — definitions and application guidance in appendices: the language and format were updated in line with recent Standards; definitions and application guidance moved out of the main body into appendices. EY Closer look 2026 · section 1 EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 1 IAS 8 renamed Basis of Preparation of Financial Statements and absorbs IAS 1 requirements: What moves to IAS 8: unchanged IAS 1 requirements transferred in part to IAS 8 Basis of Preparation of Financial Statements (formerly Accounting Policies, Changes in Accounting Estimates and Errors); consequential amendments change IAS 8’s title to better reflect amended content. Examples of → IAS 8 — fair presentation & compliance, going concern, accrual basis, disclosures of accounting policies, and sources of estimation uncertainty: Fair presentation & compliance Going concern Accrual basis Disclosures of accounting policies Sources of estimation uncertainty IFRS 18 · para IN3 IFRS 18 · para BC1 fn EY Closer look 2026 · Overview fn2 KPMG FI 2024 · Appendix"
