    "text": "3.5.1 — Applying the ordered tests to each amount Step What to do Start Take each P&L amount. Ask first whether it is discontinued operations (paragraph 68) or income taxes (paragraph 67). Those bands are not re-tested into operating/investing/financing. IFRS 18 · para 67–68 IFRS 18 · para B29 Decision Apply investing (paragraphs 53–58) and financing (paragraphs 59–66) with the SMBA nest in view. If a specified MBA (or paragraph 64) has already pulled the amount into operating, answer “no” at that test. Ordinary non-specified MBA results never needed a paragraph 49 test — they were already inside operating. IFRS 18 · para 49–52 IFRS 18 · para B30 IFRS 18 · para B42 Output Ask “which category?” before inventing management labels. Whatever remains is operating residual. MPM views come later (Ch6), after the IFRS bands exist. IFRS 18 · para 52 IFRS 18 · para 117"
