    "text": "3.5.15 — Customer-financing entities — subtotal, hybrids, derivatives, derecognition and FX Topic Requirement for a customer-financing entity Profit before financing and income taxes Not permitted if the entity classifies all unrelated Type 1 amounts in operating. Consider an additional subtotal after investing and before financing (paragraph 24), e.g. operating profit plus equity-accounted results; its label must not imply financing is excluded — ‘profit before financing’ is prohibited. EY view: label precision matters, but the number of subtotals is not restricted. IFRS 18 · para 73 IFRS 18 · para 74 IFRS 18 · para BC189–BC190 EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.3.3.G EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 3.3.3.A KPMG FI 2024 · section 8.1.1.3 Hybrids — Type 1, not separated Related to customer financing → operating; unrelated → the paragraph 65 policy choice. IFRS 18 · para B56(b) IFRS 18 · para 65(a)(ii) EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.3.3.H EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 3.3.3.B Hybrids — Type 2 at amortised cost, not separated Financing for all amounts after initial recognition; never eligible for operating, because Type 2 interest is never operating. IFRS 18 · para B56(c)(i) IFRS 18 · para B59 IFRS 18 · para BC177 EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.3.3.H Derivatives not used to manage identified risks Operating if not related to a raising-finance transaction, or if related to one and to customer financing; policy choice if related to raising finance but not to customer financing. IFRS 18 · para B73 IFRS 18 · para B59 EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.3.3.I EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 3.3.3.C Derecognition of liabilities Gain or loss on prepaying a related Type 1 loan → operating; on an unrelated Type 1 loan → follows the policy choice. IFRS 18 · para B61 EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.3.3.J EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 3.3.3.D FX differences Follow the related item, with the undue-cost-or-effort fallback; FX on a related foreign-currency Type 1 liability → operating. IFRS 18 · para B65–B66 IFRS 18 · para B68 EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.3.3.K EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 3.3.3.E"
