    "text": "4.3.1 — Line items required by IFRS 9 and IFRS 17 Source Line item (paragraph 75) IFRS 9 (i) Interest revenue calculated using the effective interest method — presented separately within revenue. IFRS 18 · para 75(b)(i) IFRS 18 · para 75(a)(i) (ii) Impairment losses, including reversals or impairment gains, determined under Section 5.5 of IFRS 9. IFRS 18 · para 75(b)(ii) (iii) Gains and losses on derecognition of financial assets measured at amortised cost. IFRS 18 · para 75(b)(iii) (iv) Gain or loss from the difference between fair value and previous amortised cost when a financial asset is reclassified to fair value through profit or loss. IFRS 18 · para 75(b)(iv) (v) Cumulative OCI gain or loss reclassified to profit or loss when a financial asset moves from fair value through OCI to fair value through profit or loss. IFRS 18 · para 75(b)(v) IFRS 17 (i) Insurance revenue — presented separately within revenue. IFRS 18 · para 75(c)(i) IFRS 18 · para 75(a)(i) (ii) Insurance service expenses from contracts issued. IFRS 18 · para 75(c)(ii) (iii) Income or expenses from reinsurance contracts held. IFRS 18 · para 75(c)(iii) (iv) Insurance finance income or expenses from contracts issued. IFRS 18 · para 75(c)(iv) (v) Finance income or expenses from reinsurance contracts held. IFRS 18 · para 75(c)(v)"
