    "text": "4.3.3 — Line items in the financing category No listed financing line. Paragraph 75 adds no financing expense line items; the role of the primary financial statements replaces the IAS 1 ‘finance costs’ line. IFRS 18 · para BC242 EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.4.1 EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 3.4.1 What the financing band holds. (a) Initial and subsequent measurement of Type 1 liabilities; (b) Incremental issue and extinguishment costs of Type 1 liabilities; (c) Interest and interest-rate effects on Type 2 liabilities, only where identified for other requirements ( Ch3 3.4 ) IFRS 18 · para BC242(a)–(c) Splitting the band. The Type 1 / Type 2 distinction is an operational mechanism, not a definition of ‘financing activities’; whether to show them separately is a useful-structured-summary judgement. IE7 shows two financing lines (borrowings and leases; pensions and provisions). IFRS 18 · para BC243 IFRS 18 · para IE7 Single line, notes still apply. Even with one financing line on the face, disclose disaggregated information in the notes when material. IFRS 18 · para BC243 EY Closer look 2026 · section 3.4.1 EY iGAAP 2026 Ch04 · section 3.4.1"
